      55.17,
      439.86,
      295.24,
      499.38
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands & ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed fora public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.",
    "fonts": [
